WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.650
Welcome to Cattle Handler,

00:01.800 --> 00:04.100
an all-in-one cattle treatment
management system

00:04.100 --> 00:06.200
built for real-world operations.

00:07.200 --> 00:09.200
Record complete treatments in seconds.

00:09.750 --> 00:12.150
Keep pens, headcounts, cattle histories,

00:12.400 --> 00:15.150
and recent activity organized
and easy to find.

00:16.000 --> 00:17.900
Pen management made simple.

00:18.750 --> 00:21.950
Owner totals and monthly billing reports
are calculated automatically,

00:22.400 --> 00:23.900
giving the office clean information

00:23.900 --> 00:26.400
without sorting through texts
or handwritten notes.

00:26.950 --> 00:30.100
Track every treatment through
its active 90-day window

00:30.300 --> 00:32.950
and never lose sight of a treatment
or follow-up again.

00:33.600 --> 00:34.450
Cattle Handler.

00:34.850 --> 00:36.750
Less paperwork. More control.

00:37.250 --> 00:39.000
Built by Inselman Digital.
